Third-party components and influences:

* Baritone (https://github.com/cabaletta/baritone) — LGPL-3.0.
  The pathfinding cost model (ActionCosts), movement taxonomy, goal types,
  default settings, and command surface are ported from Baritone. This project
  is a derivative work of Baritone's design and is therefore licensed under
  LGPL-3.0.

* BedrockTools (https://github.com/QYCottage/BedrockTools) — MIT License.
  Source of the verified Minecraft 1.26.60 (arm64) signature patterns, class
  offsets, vtable slots, and the MoveInputComponent layout used by the SDK
  layer in include/levibatone/sdk/ and src/core/.

* LiteLDev/preloader-android (https://github.com/LiteLDev/preloader-android) —
  the LeviLauncher native mod runtime; headers only, linked at runtime.

* resources/minecraft.ttf — Minecraft font, bundled for HUD overlay text
  (same as BedrockTools' approach). Property of Mojang/Microsoft; use is
  subject to the Minecraft EULA. Not covered by this project's license.

* fmt (https://github.com/fmtlib/fmt) and entt (https://github.com/skypjack/entt)
  — build-time dependencies, not distributed in the .levipack.
